  "lore": "Ask the brigade about MiseOS Docs Builder and they describe a shelf of labelled jars that each tell a story. As Data & Insight Kitchen's Container, MiseOS Docs Builder manages slow processes (ferments, cures, brines) by tracking time, salinity and cultures until they are proven ready, and the rest of the kitchen plans service around that rhythm. The card calls out Architecture, Modules, Interfaces: the checks MiseOS Docs Builder runs before calling anything ready.",
